Godot’s editor/ code in version 4.5, the editor/inspector/ directory now houses all inspector-related widgets, while editor/settings/ contains code pertaining to EditorSettings and ProjectSettings.\r\n\r\nHowever, editor/inspector/editor_sectioned_inspector is exclusively used by EditorSettings and ProjectSettings. For better code organization and adherence to the project’s directory structure, this file should be moved to the editor/settings/ directory. This PR also removes some unnecessary editor_sectioned_inspector include statements.\r\n\r\nThis is my first time contributing to the Godot community, and I would be honored if this PR is accepted.\r\n\r\nI suspect the confusion stems from the filename editor_sectioned_inspector, which does not clearly reflect its actual purpose. I suggest renaming it to either editor_settings_browser or editor_settings_explorer. I am happy to implement this renaming in the same PR if the suggestion is approved.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_i